        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br><strong>3. 제출서류</strong> : 참가신청서(첨부양식)<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br><strong>4. 제 출 처</strong> : 취업정보센터(선착순 접수)<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br><strong>5. 마 감 일</strong> : 2009. 6. 24(수)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>6.&nbsp;문 의 처</strong>&nbsp;: 478-7211</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font size=\"3\">취 업 정 보 센 터</font></strong></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
